``` Encoded PowerShell execution
    MITRE ATT&CK: T1059.001 PowerShell
    Logic: PowerShell process creation with an encoded command, from Sysmon Event ID 1.
    Known false positives: management agents and installers that use -EncodedCommand.
    Tuning: exclude by signed parent and known decoded content. ```
index=sysmon EventCode=1 (Image="*\\powershell.exe" OR Image="*\\pwsh.exe")
| regex CommandLine="(?i)\s-e(n|nc|nco|ncod|ncode|ncoded|ncodedcommand)?\s+[A-Za-z0-9+/=]{20,}"
| table _time host User ParentImage ParentCommandLine CommandLine
| sort - _time
